#==============================================================================================
#
#   html_button_element - HTML::HTMLButtonElement: <button>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/HTML/HTMLButtonElement.cpp (lines 1-352) and the inline functions of
#       HTMLButtonElement.h: construction (which moves the mixin tables to HTMLButtonElement's,
#       as C++'s vptrs move), button layout's display adjustment, the type attribute's states,
#       the value, the activation behavior (submitting or resetting the form owner, the command
#       and commandfor attributes, the popover target), the command IDL attribute and the
#       FormAssociatedElement overrides.
